<title>FRANCE: Algeria rejects durum tender offers.</title>
<headline>Algeria rejects durum tender offers.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-01-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Algeria rejected all offers to supply durum wheat at a tender and is expected to launch a new one, European grain traders said on Friday.</p>
<p>Algeria tendered on Thursday for three 50,000-tonne shipments of durum between mid-March and the end of April.  </p>
<p>It had said it would consider offers from the United States, Canada or Syria.</p>
<p>There was no word on the date of the next tender.</p>
</text>
